&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;This is 28mm scale miniature is ideal for tabletop role playing games such as D&amp;amp;D or Pathfinder. It is scaled to be printed as a -Large- miniature, which would fit on a 50.8mm diameter base. These sharks are big! If you attempt to print these as a medium sized creature, scale down to 50% (And take a picture, I&amp;#39;d love to see it!)
